  "ingredients": [
    "1.5 cups all-purpose flour",
    "0.75 cup white sugar",
    "2 teaspoons baking powder",
    "1 teaspoon ground cinnamon",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "1 egg",
    "0.33333334326744 cup vegetable oil",
    "0.33333334326744 cup milk",
    "2 apples - peeled, cored and chopped",
    "0.5 cup white sugar",
    "0.33333334326744 cup all-purpose flour",
    "0.5 cup butter, cubed",
    "1.5 teaspoons ground cinnamon"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients. Preheat the oven to 425 degrees F (220 degrees C). Line 6 large (3½-inch) muffin cups with paper muffin liners.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/XY0fn9T2g5EiEmf7RSsaOa50BE0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24352-easy-apple-cinnamon-muffins-ddmfs-0158-4x3-step01-110fb23365ea40ce95da56ee69d8e1a3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24352/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the muffins: Stir flour, sugar, baking powder, cinnamon, and salt together in a large bowl. Mix in egg, oil, and milk until just combined. Fold in chopped apples.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/TFjzTw1D-_uXE3DR2qWfmKQZKy8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24352-easy-apple-cinnamon-muffins-ddmfs-0161-4x3-step02-6b3c77523ab3482b832666c9a07f4d7b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24352/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spoon ½ cup of batter into each muffin liner.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/7K74DN9mlQ8ziD15-uxog7ZC3Mw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24352-easy-apple-cinnamon-muffins-ddmfs-0162-4x3-step03-e80fe1e1f4514171b3ab18aabe5932e0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24352/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the streusel topping: Place sugar, flour, butter, and cinnamon into a small bowl; mash mixture with a fork until mixture begins to cling together. Sprinkle topping evenly over unbaked muffins.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/56oUgF2IkaJhIOAVPOArpa9uAR8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24352-easy-apple-cinnamon-muffins-ddmfs-0164-4x3-step04-1ce34c15e1214adc89cfd564847591fe.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24352/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven for 5 minutes. Reduce oven temperature to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C) and bake until a toothpick inserted into the center of a muffin comes out clean, 25 to 30 minutes. Let cool in pan briefly; remove muffins and cool on a wire rack.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4miGPUjHC5dC3AR44DJhFesUlWU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24352-easy-apple-cinnamon-muffins-ddmfs-0198-4x3-step05-2b18a3d559b2462e85b76c707f83187e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24352/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ow7GMW2ETGOPtlR9UDaG3fcVB1o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24352-easy-apple-cinnamon-muffins-ddmfs-0231-4x3-beauty-d9261c6332f1476d8bc958982f03d654.jpg"
